atlas apps
# The nine Frappe apps as first-class wired organs -- projections over shared
# semantic objects, not separate destinations. Each declares the mature powers it
# donates into the fabric (owns/publishes) and the fabric facts it reads
# (consumes), per the wiring riff SS5. The Frappe apps are real; their fabric
# wiring is architectural (a manifest), not yet implemented -- hence maturity
# architectural and an honest known_gap on each. `atlas.py wiring` then shows which
# app<->fabric feedback loops close (CRM<->actor, HRMS<->work, ERPNext<->provider)
# and which app outputs are human surfaces (terminal producers).

architecture frappe-core
  canonical_name FrappeCore
  family apps
  domain Apps / Platform
  layer surface
  semantic_question What DocType, form, permission and workflow grammar does a record present?
  purpose Donates DocType schemas, forms, permissions, workflows, reports. Shapes records; it never owns the authority that gates them.
  maturity architectural
  owns DocType
  consumes Authority
  publishes SurfaceGrammar
  publishes Policy
  forbidden_inference a DocType exists -> the record is authorized (Authority gates; a DocType only shapes)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap the Frappe platform is real; this fabric WiringSpec is architectural, not yet implemented

architecture erpnext
  canonical_name ERPNext
  family apps
  domain Apps / Economic Truth
  layer surface
  semantic_question What value, receipt and stock movement actually occurred (realized, not forecast)?
  purpose Donates double-entry transaction truth, inventory, party economics. Authoritative for realized Value and Receipt; feeds provider evidence and Insights.
  maturity architectural
  owns Value
  owns Receipt
  consumes WorkState
  consumes ProviderState
  publishes Value
  publishes Receipt
  forbidden_inference a forecast -> realized money (Value here is booked/realized, never projected)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap ERPNext is real; the fabric wiring that feeds realized outcomes back into provider selection is architectural

architecture crm
  canonical_name CRM
  family apps
  domain Apps / Relationship
  layer surface
  semantic_question What is the current relationship, communication and deal state with an actor?
  purpose Donates the relationship/timeline/deal grammar. A projection over actors it does not own -- actor-graph owns identity; CRM surfaces the relationship.
  maturity architectural
  consumes Actor
  consumes Relation
  consumes OccurrenceProjection
  publishes CommunicationEvent
  publishes DealState
  forbidden_inference a CRM record -> a verified actor identity (CRM projects; actor-graph owns identity)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap CRM is real; wiring its communication events back into the actor/relationship graph is architectural

architecture hrms
  canonical_name HRMS
  family apps
  domain Apps / Human Capacity
  layer surface
  semantic_question Who is available, with what qualification and capacity, for what work?
  purpose Donates availability, qualification, attendance, shift. Authoritative for HumanCapacity; feeds WorkGraph routing.
  maturity architectural
  owns HumanCapacity
  consumes Actor
  consumes WorkState
  publishes HumanCapacity
  forbidden_inference attendance present -> capability proven (availability is not demonstrated proficiency)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap HRMS is real; wiring human capacity into work routing is architectural

architecture helpdesk
  canonical_name Helpdesk
  family apps
  domain Apps / Issue Lifecycle
  layer surface
  semantic_question What is the state of this requester's problem, and who owns resolving it?
  purpose Donates problem lifecycle, SLA, assignment, escalation. Folds inbound occurrences into structured tickets.
  maturity architectural
  owns TicketState
  consumes Actor
  consumes WorkState
  consumes OccurrenceProjection
  publishes TicketState
  forbidden_inference a ticket resolved -> the underlying problem is gone (resolution is a claim, not proof)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap Helpdesk is real; wiring occurrences into its ticket lifecycle is architectural

architecture lms
  canonical_name LMS
  family apps
  domain Apps / Capability Acquisition
  layer surface
  semantic_question What capability has an actor acquired, and is it credentialed?
  purpose Donates prerequisites, progression, assessment, credential. Feeds capability/opportunity eligibility and evidence of proficiency.
  maturity architectural
  owns Credential
  consumes Actor
  publishes Credential
  publishes Evidence
  forbidden_inference a course completed -> capability proven for work (completion is not demonstrated proficiency)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap LMS is real; wiring credentials into provider eligibility and work routing is architectural

architecture wiki
  canonical_name Wiki
  family apps
  domain Apps / Knowledge
  layer surface
  semantic_question What does the institution claim to know, with what evidence and freshness?
  purpose Donates knowledge hierarchy, revision, citation. A knowledge claim carries its evidence and proof-frontier state; invalidated evidence marks the claim stale.
  maturity architectural
  owns KnowledgeClaim
  consumes Evidence
  consumes ProofFrontier
  publishes KnowledgeClaim
  forbidden_inference published knowledge -> current truth (a claim can be invalidated after publication)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap Wiki is real; carrying claim/evidence/proof-frontier refs on knowledge is architectural

architecture drive
  canonical_name Drive
  family apps
  domain Apps / Resource Navigation
  layer surface
  semantic_question How does a human navigate, share, preview and version any addressable resource?
  purpose Donates the mature file/folder/share/version grammar to BonfyreFS -- the visual grammar of the universal namespace. A projection; Authority still gates effects.
  maturity architectural
  consumes Artifact
  consumes Authority
  consumes RouteAdvertisement
  consumes NamespaceProjection
  publishes ShareGrant
  publishes RepresentationHistory
  forbidden_inference a share grant -> authority to act (Drive shares a projection; Authority gates the effect)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap Drive is real; resolving its folders through the AddressPlane/BonfyreFS namespace is architectural

architecture insights
  canonical_name Insights
  family apps
  domain Apps / Differential Surface
  layer surface
  semantic_question What is the current derived state, charted for a human, deep-linkable to its objects?
  purpose Donates query/metric/dashboard composition. The human grammar of Feldera's maintained derived state; charts differential truth, never commits.
  maturity architectural
  owns DerivedView
  consumes ReachableCapacity
  consumes Value
  consumes OpportunityEligibility
  consumes ResourcePressure
  publishes DerivedView
  forbidden_inference a dashboard number -> a committed fact (Insights charts derived state; it never commits)
  source_lineage aurekai institution vision (9 Frappe apps as one institutional graph)
  known_gap Insights is real; wiring it to consume Feldera-maintained sets directly is architectural
